      "comment": "Acidithiobacillus ferrooxidans DSMZ 11477 was used throughout this study."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": "The cells were cultured in Kim medium (g L–1): KCl, 0.1; MgSO4⋅7H2O, 0.2; (NH4)H2PO4, 2.0; and supplemented with FeSO4⋅7H2O, 44; the pH was adjusted to 1.8 with H2SO4 10N (Kim et al., 2002)."
